  "ingredients": [
    "8 ounces feta cheese, crumbled",
    "3 tablespoons finely chopped green onions",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "1 (17.5 ounce) package frozen puff pastry, thawed",
    "1 egg yolk, beaten with 1 teaspoon water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9DRjsA1-7Q3GE6_lDUfCHe-hlxg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13509-feta-cheese-foldovers-DDMFS-step-01-83584debc5664fa099e54f58200a8171.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13509/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, blend feta cheese, green onions, and egg.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aX2dESn-vb2MU9Q98_mX3m6-SJI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13509-feta-cheese-foldovers-DDMFS-step-02-7d40422599bc4288a4ca3cd5dbf0804b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13509/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut pastry into 12 (3 inch) squares. Place a mounded tablespoon of feta mixture in the center of each square.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gJC_UTqvB_OiJDn2dm128vMo8yY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13509-feta-cheese-foldovers-DDMFS-step-03-ab500de0939648b2901d4dff6d88e57a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13509/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Moisten edges with water, and fold pastry over filling to form a triangle. Press edges together firmly with a fork to seal. Lightly brush pastries with the egg yolk mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mw7qLeK7Dl9qLl1ZGH4V2vTTM_k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13509-feta-cheese-foldovers-DDMFS-step-04-6db2103117d543fd9ca899cdb85415b9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13509/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 20 minutes in the preheated oven, or until golden brown. Serve warm or at room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JVnGOhrbHm5cDQtEibAiUg5itIk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13509-feta-cheese-foldovers-DDMFS-step-05-52495c82159a481d9ba4dbe9aa9c2eeb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13509/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
